OL,3,GNEWSACyclist backs CPR campaign after
OL,4,Ahaving life saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had a cardiac arrest by the
OL,7,Fside of a road and survived after
OL,8,Fpassers-by gave CPR for more than 20
OL,9,Fminutes has backed a push to train more
OL,10,Fpeople to help save others.
OL,12,FCraig Ormiston said he spent three
OL,13,Fweeks sedated at the William Harvey
OL,14,FHospital in Ashford in Kent after
OL,15,Fcollapsing while cycling near Brands
OL,16,FHatch in June 2025.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
