OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACyclist backs CPR campaign after
OL,4,Ahaving life saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrmiston, a former triathlete, was
OL,7,Fsaved after passers-by Emma Stanney and
OL,8,FRichard Harrington began doing chest
OL,9,Fcompressions while waiting for
OL,10,Fparamedics and an air ambulance to
OL,11,Farrive.
OL,13,F"It's all good and well being trained
OL,14,Fbut you have to have the belief and
OL,15,Fbravery to get started," Ormiston said.
